	<!--states/idle-->
	
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_1">
		<text>Sick of it... How sick of it am I...</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_2">
		<text>Anomalies... hell... That's the scariest for sure! ... How that stalker... how he was roasted! ... And the another one left on trees... torn by pieces ... No god, better to die by bullet! </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_3">
		<text>I will make it! I will break my teeth but make it!... Most important to keep sane, or everything is lost. </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_4">
		<text>I shouldn't have seen that corpse... How that creature ate him! ... What's happening in the Zone! ... Need to tell someone – but it's forbidden! </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_5">
		<text>They say, those spawns started to attack patrols at night. Notably – at day they shit each other, at night they merge at packs and kill ours! </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_6">
		<text>You should watch yourself all the time here ... Also should watch other ones ... Anomalies, these damn mutants — very easy to go crazy. Already seen it.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_7">
		<text>I feel, I lost five kilos here already</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_8">
		<text>No normal wild meat in this damn Zone. Bad... Very bad.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_9">
		<text>Hmm... If only I could have some smoked meat now...</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_10">
		<text>If only I could eat some buckwheat with stew! Yeaahh! I would finish it in a second!</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_11">
		<text>Ehh, greenish boredom! Here, everything is ... equally damned!</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_12">
		<text>Eh... and when are they going to get us out of here?</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_13">
		<text>No... I won't give up so easily.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_14">
		<text>Heh. Staff fooled us for a while: "There's nothing worse than stalkers" – Yeeaaaah!</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_15">
		<text>We will get through, of course! Fuck those monsters, they won't get our backs! If only rifle wouldn't jam and there was enough ammo. – We will get through! </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_20">
		<text>Interesting story, it seems! Contract is for two years, right? Pension is premial – that, those... But I don't remember anyone who made it to the ... Oh no, did I fuck up?</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_21">
		<text>That contract, scum, is getting on my nerves – we work like fresh conscripts!</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_22">
		<text>They go without stopping! From both sides! From outside – stalkers assault us, from the inside – ... these creatures are already enough!</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_23">
		<text>And it's all for nothing! We stand on borders! We seem to guard them! But Zone is full of stalkers anyway! And where do these idiots even come from?</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_states_idle_idle_24">
		<text>Where are those boars from supply service stuck again? Heh, they ate 5 minutes ago, I think, and we didn't have anything warm for three days!</text>
	</string>
	
