	<!--talk/intros-->

	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_intros_intro_joke_1">
		<text>We had one in our platoon – he could really light it up! One example: </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_intros_intro_joke_2">
		<text>So, a civil joke: </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_intros_intro_joke_3">
		<text>So, listen: </text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_intros_intro_joke_4">
		<text>That's what I once was told: </text>
	</string>
	
	<!--talk/jokes-->
	
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_1">
		<text>In military settlement, captain's wife comes to general: "Comrade general, I found a bra in my husband's pocket, but what do I do?" – "Give it to me, I will solve it myself". 
		At evening general returns home, his wife finds bra, forgotten in pocket: "Honey, you are such a prankster, I was looking for this bra all day!"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_2">
		<text>So, two conscripts decided to make fun of warrant:"Comrade warrant officer, what's heavier: kilogram of cotton or kilogram of iron?" – "Erm, of course ... kilogram of iron" – warrant says.
		Conscript says:"Wrong! – they weigh equally!" – Warrant: "Let's look the difference if I strike you in head with kilo of cotton first, then with kilo of iron!"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_3">
		<text>General teaches the staff:"And remember: usually, after testing in battle, "well-protected rear" in reality turns out to be completely unprotected ass!"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_4">
		<text>Catched one old stalker and interrogating him:"People say, you have an assault rifle" – stalker:"They are lying!" – soldier:"People say, you have a machine gun" – stalker:
		"Of course they are lying!" – soldier:"People say, you have a battle tank" – stalker:"If I don't have something – I don't have it"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_5">
		<text>Once, two satellites collided in skies: american and ours. Americans lie that their satellite wasn't spying. Ours lie that our satellite was uncontrollable.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_6">
		<text>So, once general arrives at Cordon checkpoint and asks one of conscripts:"How's your service, son?" – "It's okay, comrade general, getting used to id" – "Imagine soldier: now you are protecting people from Zone. How did you get here? By your own wish?" – "Well, I agree that we should protect people from Zone" – general smiles:"What an conscious soldier!" – soldier continues: "that's why I told military commisar thousand times:"There's nothing for me to do in Zone", but he... bitch"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_7">
		<text>Once warrant was passing medical examination, eye doctor tells him:"Close your left eye, which letters do you see?" – warrant is silent. doctor repeats: "I say, close left eye, which letters?" 
		– warrant is silent. Doctor is confused: "What are you, completely blind?!" – "No, doctor, I am not blind, I see these letters clearly, but I can't remember how are they called"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_8">
		<text>Checkpoint commander tortures conscript with guard duty rules:"Listen here, Ivanov:you stand on your post at night, suddenly you see: something dark crawls to you! Your actions?"
		– conscript:"Well, I will help you get home, comrade commander"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_9">
		<text>General says to soldier:"I see, soldier, you are very smart?" – soldier:"Who? Me?". – general:"Who else? Me?"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_10">
		<text>New colonel arrived to military base: everything settled, then smoking time, he tells officers the joke: everyone laughs, but one lieutenant doesn't. 
		Colonel asks:"Listen lieutenant, everyone find my joke funny and you don't?" – "Comrade colonel, that's because I am from other base"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_11">
		<text>First-year conscript complains in clothes supply room:"Comrade warrant officer, why I got such bullshit? Pants only covering my knees, shirt is loose and sleeves are too short, boots are falling off by themselves. I looked in mirror and got scared of myself!" Warrant says:"It's okay soldier, everything is as it should be, remember: we should always scare the enemies!"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_military_1_talk_jokes_joke_12">
		<text>Helicopter pilot arrived to medical examination, undressed, being examined, doctor asks him questions and pilot responds:"Height – 190. Weight – 102. Spyrometry – what the hell is that?" – "How much can you inhale?" – "Around 2 liters" – "Strange, kind of too little, and your card says that you can inhale four." – "Ah, I inhale 4 liters of vodka only during celebrations".</text>
	</string>
